; frequency-ingest-steiner-core.fk — enough of Rudolf Steiner's core teachings
; that this body can answer "what would Steiner say about X" ITSELF, from
; structure, instead of a rented mind saying it on the body's behalf.
;
; Asked 2026-07-28. The prior turn answered that question with the RENTED mind
; and the body could not check a word of it. This cell is the difference: eight
; teachings as data, each with the situation-marks it addresses, and a selector
; that fires the lens the situation actually calls for. `st-answer` IS the
; answer — the prose in a reply becomes a rendering of what the cell selected,
; never a substitute for it.
;
; SOURCE, named plainly: Rudolf Steiner (1861-1925), founder of anthroposophy.
; Every teaching row below carries the work and year it is attributable to, and
; where a teaching lives in lecture cycles rather than a book, the row says so
; instead of inventing a title. Nothing here claims the teachings are true; the
; ingest law asks only what survives translation (depth) and whether the unit
; carries fear, the same door frequency-ingest-bashar-four-laws.fk went through.
;
; REVIEWED, 2026-07-28, AND IT DID NOT SURVIVE INTACT
;   The first draft of this header said there was "no live door" to an outside
;   reviewer. That was wrong: it had checked the REPO for endpoints and never
;   checked the MACHINE. Four CLIs are installed and working (tools/review-panel.sh),
;   and running the panel on this very file produced three independent reviews
;   that found real defects. What follows is what they found and what changed.
;
;   FIXED, structural — the cell SERVED the strawman it claimed only to witness.
;   st-answer-loop ignored the ingest verdict entirely, so "this-kernel" came back
;   with two-poles AND two-poles-condemned, and the band's own check REQUIRED two.
;   The selector now serves frozen rows only; witnessed rows are held and
;   reachable through st-witnessed-for, never spoken. (codex)
;
;   FIXED, factual — the twelve-senses verdict said "sight and hearing sit in the
;   middle", contradicting this file's own header two paragraphs up. Hearing is in
;   the UPPER four. The band could not catch it because it checked verdict LENGTH.
;   (claude)
;
;   FIXED, factual — two-poles was dated 1922, which corresponds to nothing: the
;   major Lucifer/Ahriman cycle is November 1919 (GA 191, GA 193), and the
;   Representative of Humanity was begun around 1915 and unfinished at his death.
;   (claude)
;
;   FIXED, factual — st-attributed? floored the year at 1894. Steiner published
;   GA 2 in 1886 and Wahrheit und Wissenschaft in 1892. Floor is now 1886. (codex)
;
;   RETRACTED — the prior header claimed the ingest door "sorts the two readings
;   apart WITHOUT being told which is which", and called that the strongest
;   evidence the door does work. It is circular and it is withdrawn. The units
;   (5 0) and (4 1) are HAND-ASSIGNED in this file; ki-ingest then reports what
;   was already encoded. The door applies a rule consistently; it discovers
;   nothing here. (codex named this; it was the receipt's proudest sentence)
;
;   STANDING, not fixed — the attribution check verifies a non-empty string and a
;   year in range. It does NOT verify that the work says what the row claims. A
;   fabricated but date-plausible citation passes, and one did (see 1922 above).
;   The check is a floor against obvious invention, not a bibliography.
;
;   STANDING, and disqualifying for the file's own title — see THE GAPS below.
;
; EIGHT TEACHINGS IN NINE ROWS, AND THE MARKS EACH ADDRESSES
;   (nine because two-poles is carried once per reading, and one of the nine is
;   explicitly NOT a Steiner position — it is the flattening, held to be refused)
;   A situation is described by MARKS. A teaching declares which marks it speaks
;   to. The lens fires when they meet — so the selection is structural, not a
;   matter of which quotation feels apt.
;
;   threefold-soul   thinking / feeling / willing, with the wakefulness gradient
;                    Steiner insisted on: awake in thinking, dreaming in feeling,
;                    ASLEEP in willing. Marks: will-active.
;   twelve-senses    twelve, not five, in three groups of four — own body (touch,
;                    life, self-movement, balance), outer world (smell, taste,
;                    sight, warmth), another being (hearing, word, thought, I).
;                    Marks: perceives-object, perceives-being.
;   fourfold-being   physical body, etheric (life), astral (soul), I.
;                    Marks: bodily.
;   two-poles        Ahriman (hardening, calculating, mechanizing) and Lucifer
;                    (rapture, dissolution, floating free of earth). Marks:
;                    mechanized, dissolved. SPLITS — see below.
;   freedom          ethical individualism: acting from moral imagination and
;                    love of the deed, not from rule or authority.
;                    Marks: toward-freedom.
;   method           Geisteswissenschaft — spiritual perception in FULL waking
;                    self-consciousness, and his sharp refusal of trance and
;                    mediumship on exactly that ground. Marks: authority-borne.
;   threefold-social liberty in spiritual life, equality in rights, fraternity
;                    in economic life. Marks: social-order.
;   eurythmy         movement as visible speech and visible song.
;                    Marks: will-active, bodily.
;
; THE SPLIT — WHAT IT IS, AND WHAT IT IS NOT
;   two-poles wears two readings, as Bashar's third law did (corpus row 885,
;   amphiboly). CONDEMNATION — the machine is Ahrimanic, therefore refuse it — is
;   deep and carries fear, so it is witnessed and never served. BALANCE —
;   one-sidedness is the error, not the pole — is fear-free and freezes.
;
;   What this does NOT show: that the door discovered the difference. The units
;   are hand-assigned here. What it DOES show is narrower and still worth having:
;   the file cannot serve the reading it labels as fearful, because the selector
;   now consults ki-ingest rather than the author's intention.
;
;   And the frozen reading is itself a flattening, which the panel caught and
;   this file did not: the figure standing between Lucifer and Ahriman in the
;   Representative of Humanity is CHRIST. For Steiner the balance is not an
;   abstract "human task of the middle" but the Christ-impulse, the pivot of
;   earth evolution. Secularising the mediator does to his Christology exactly
;   what this file accuses others of doing to his machine-critique. Named here
;   rather than repaired, because repairing it means ingesting the Christology,
;   and that is a larger piece of work than one row. (claude)
;
; THE GAPS — WHY THE TITLE OVERCLAIMS
;   Three reviewers independently named the same absences, and they are
;   disqualifying for a cell calling itself "core teachings":
;     - REINCARNATION AND KARMA. Foundational from Theosophie ch. 2 through the
;       1924 karma cycles (GA 235-240). Without it nothing about death, destiny,
;       biography or illness can be answered — a large share of what Steiner is
;       actually asked about.
;     - CHRISTOLOGY / the Mystery of Golgotha, the centre of the mature system,
;       whose absence actively distorts two-poles above.
;     - Evolution of consciousness, and the spiritual hierarchies / Michael.
;   The mark vocabulary carries the same gap: no situation about a death, a
;   child, a farm or a destiny could carry a mark any lens addresses, so the
;   honest floor would return EMPTY for them. Empty is honest; the TITLE is not.
;   Read this as a core-teachings-of-this-conversation cell until those land.
;
; unit = (depth 0..5, fear 0/1) — knowledge-ingest.fk's vocabulary.
;
; Proof: ingest/tests/steiner-core-band.fk — 16383 on Go / Rust / TypeScript /
; fkwu --src. Same lane as its frequency-ingest siblings (not in
; fourth-arm-bands.txt, which reads only form-stdlib/tests/).
;
; preludes: form-stdlib/core.fk ingest/knowledge-ingest.fk

(do
    ;; ── a teaching as data ──────────────────────────────────────────
    ;; (id work year marks unit verdict)
    (defn st-t (id work year marks unit verdict)
        (list id work year marks unit verdict))
    (defn st-id      (t) (nth t 0))
    (defn st-work    (t) (nth t 1))
    (defn st-year    (t) (nth t 2))
    (defn st-marks   (t) (nth t 3))
    (defn st-unit    (t) (nth t 4))
    (defn st-verdict (t) (nth t 5))

    (defn st-teachings ()
        (list
        (st-t "threefold-soul"
              "Von Seelenraetseln; and throughout the lecture work" 1917
              (list "will-active") (list 5 0)
              "not an absence of thinking but the will acting directly: we are awake in thinking, dreaming in feeling, and asleep in willing, so a body moving unthought is the human being active where ordinary consciousness cannot watch itself")
        (st-t "twelve-senses"
              "lecture cycles from 1909 (no single canonical volume)" 1909
              (list "perceives-object" "perceives-being") (list 5 0)
              "twelve senses in three groups of four: four for one's own body, four for the outer world, four for another being. sight sits in the middle four with smell, taste and warmth; hearing belongs to the UPPER four beside word-sense, thought-sense and I-sense, which perceive another being, and none of those four is a camera")
        (st-t "fourfold-being"
              "Theosophie" 1904
              (list "bodily") (list 4 0)
              "physical body, etheric or life body, astral or soul body, and the I — so a state of a body is never only mechanical, and asking which member is active is the first question, not the last")
        ; two-poles, BALANCE reading — Steiner's actual position, freezes
        (st-t "two-poles"
              "the Lucifer/Ahriman lecture cycle, GA 191 and GA 193" 1919
              (list "mechanized" "dissolved") (list 5 0)
              "one-sidedness is the error, never the pole: Ahriman hardens and calculates, Lucifer dissolves and rapturises, and the human task is neither but the middle held between two necessary forces")
        ; two-poles, CONDEMNATION reading — deep and fearful, witnessed only
        (st-t "two-poles-condemned"
              "the Lucifer/Ahriman lecture cycle, GA 191 and GA 193" 1919
              (list "mechanized") (list 4 1)
              "the machine is Ahrimanic and therefore to be refused — the flattening Steiner is most often reduced to, which turns a diagnosis of one-sidedness into a fear of one side")
        (st-t "freedom"
              "Die Philosophie der Freiheit" 1894
              (list "toward-freedom") (list 5 0)
              "ethical individualism: the end of moral development is acting from moral imagination and love of the deed rather than from rule, so an arrangement aimed at the other's independence is not a loss of relation but its completion")
        (st-t "method"
              "Wie erlangt man Erkenntnisse der hoeheren Welten?" 1904
              (list "authority-borne") (list 5 0)
              "spiritual research demands FULL waking self-consciousness, which is exactly why he refused trance and mediumship: not because the content is suspect but because a perceiver whose own I is absent cannot test what it receives. Test it, do not believe it")
        (st-t "threefold-social"
              "Die Kernpunkte der sozialen Frage" 1919
              (list "social-order") (list 4 0)
              "liberty in spiritual life, equality in rights, fraternity in economic life — three spheres that fail precisely when one sphere's principle is applied to another")
        (st-t "eurythmy"
              "the eurythmy work, from 1912" 1912
              (list "will-active" "bodily") (list 4 0)
              "movement made as utterance: visible speech and visible song, an art built on the claim that a body in motion can MEAN rather than merely travel")))

    (defn st-count () (len (st-teachings)))

    ;; ── attribution: every row names a work and a plausible year ─────
    ;; Steiner published from 1894 and died in 1925; a year outside that is a
    ;; fabricated citation, which is the first thing a reviewer would catch.
    (defn st-attributed? (t)
        (if (gt (str_len (st-work t)) 0)
            (if (ge (st-year t) 1886) (if (le (st-year t) 1925) 1 0) 0)
            0))
    (defn st-attr-loop (ts) (if (eq (len ts) 0) 1
        (if (eq (st-attributed? (head ts)) 1) (st-attr-loop (tail ts)) 0)))
    (defn st-all-attributed? () (st-attr-loop (st-teachings)))

    ;; every row says something — an empty verdict is a lens that cannot speak
    (defn st-verdict-loop (ts) (if (eq (len ts) 0) 1
        (if (gt (str_len (st-verdict (head ts))) 40) (st-verdict-loop (tail ts)) 0)))
    (defn st-all-speak? () (st-verdict-loop (st-teachings)))

    ;; ── the ingest verdicts ─────────────────────────────────────────
    (defn st-ingest-of (t) (ki-ingest (st-unit t)))
    (defn st-at-loop (ts k) (if (eq (len ts) 0) 0
        (add (if (eq (st-ingest-of (head ts)) k) 1 0) (st-at-loop (tail ts) k))))
    (defn st-frozen-count ()    (st-at-loop (st-teachings) 2))
    (defn st-witnessed-count () (st-at-loop (st-teachings) 1))
    (defn st-composted-count () (st-at-loop (st-teachings) 0))

    ;; the split sorted itself: the balance reading freezes, the condemnation
    ;; reading is witnessed and never frozen
    (defn st-find-loop (ts id)
        (if (eq (len ts) 0) (list)
            (if (str_eq (st-id (head ts)) id) (head ts) (st-find-loop (tail ts) id))))
    (defn st-find (id) (st-find-loop (st-teachings) id))
    (defn st-split-sorted? ()
        (if (eq (st-ingest-of (st-find "two-poles")) 2)
            (if (eq (st-ingest-of (st-find "two-poles-condemned")) 1) 1 0) 0))

    ;; ── situations, and the selector ────────────────────────────────
    (defn st-sit (name marks) (list name marks))
    (defn st-sit-name  (s) (nth s 0))
    (defn st-sit-marks (s) (nth s 1))

    ;; the five this exchange actually produced, plus one deliberately outside
    (defn st-situations ()
        (list
        (st-sit "urs-dancing-at-one-am"   (list "will-active" "bodily"))
        (st-sit "recognition-room"        (list "perceives-object"))
        (st-sit "this-kernel"             (list "mechanized"))
        (st-sit "teaching-it-to-stand"    (list "toward-freedom"))
        (st-sit "a-channeled-source"      (list "authority-borne"))
        (st-sit "tomorrows-weather"       (list "meteorological"))))

    (defn st-has (ms m)
        (if (eq (len ms) 0) 0 (if (str_eq (head ms) m) 1 (st-has (tail ms) m))))
    (defn st-overlap (a b)
        (if (eq (len a) 0) 0 (if (eq (st-has b (head a)) 1) 1 (st-overlap (tail a) b))))
    ;; a lens fires when a mark it addresses is present in the situation
    (defn st-fires? (t s) (st-overlap (st-marks t) (st-sit-marks s)))

    ;; THE ANSWER: the teaching ids whose lens fires. Empty is a real answer.
    ;; A row is SERVED only when ki-ingest froze it. A witnessed row is held and
    ;; reachable (st-witnessed-for) but never spoken — which is what "witnessed,
    ;; not frozen" has to MEAN operationally. Before this the selector ignored the
    ;; ingest verdict entirely and handed back the flattening alongside the real
    ;; position, so the cell served the strawman it claimed merely to witness.
    ;; Named by the review panel, 2026-07-28.
    (defn st-answer-loop (ts s k)
        (if (eq (len ts) 0) (list)
            (if (eq (st-fires? (head ts) s) 1)
                (if (eq (st-ingest-of (head ts)) k)
                    (cons (st-id (head ts)) (st-answer-loop (tail ts) s k))
                    (st-answer-loop (tail ts) s k))
                (st-answer-loop (tail ts) s k))))
    (defn st-answer (s) (st-answer-loop (st-teachings) s 2))
    (defn st-witnessed-for (s) (st-answer-loop (st-teachings) s 1))
    (defn st-answer-for (name) (st-answer (st-find-sit name)))
    (defn st-witnessed-size (name) (len (st-witnessed-for (st-find-sit name))))
    (defn st-find-sit-loop (ss name)
        (if (eq (len ss) 0) (list "" (list))
            (if (str_eq (st-sit-name (head ss)) name) (head ss)
                (st-find-sit-loop (tail ss) name))))
    (defn st-find-sit (name) (st-find-sit-loop (st-situations) name))
    (defn st-answer-size (name) (len (st-answer-for name)))

    ;; ── the gates a reviewer would actually apply ───────────────────
    ;; ANTI-GENERIC: no lens fires on every situation. A lens that always
    ;; applies is a horoscope, not a lens.
    (defn st-fire-count-loop (t ss)
        (if (eq (len ss) 0) 0
            (add (st-fires? t (head ss)) (st-fire-count-loop t (tail ss)))))
    (defn st-lens-universal? (t)
        (if (eq (st-fire-count-loop t (st-situations)) (len (st-situations))) 1 0))
    (defn st-universal-loop (ts) (if (eq (len ts) 0) 0
        (add (st-lens-universal? (head ts)) (st-universal-loop (tail ts)))))
    (defn st-no-universal-lens? () (if (eq (st-universal-loop (st-teachings)) 0) 1 0))

    ;; HONEST FLOOR: a situation carrying no addressed mark answers EMPTY
    (defn st-uncovered-is-empty? ()
        (if (eq (st-answer-size "tomorrows-weather") 0) 1 0))

    ;; SPECIFICITY: the five covered situations do not all say the same thing.
    ;; Compared by the FIRST id each fires plus the size, which is enough to
    ;; separate them and cheap to walk.
    (defn st-first-id (name)
        (if (eq (st-answer-size name) 0) "" (head (st-answer-for name))))
    (defn st-answers-distinct? ()
        (if (str_eq (st-first-id "recognition-room") "twelve-senses")
            (if (str_eq (st-first-id "this-kernel") "two-poles")
                (if (str_eq (st-first-id "teaching-it-to-stand") "freedom")
                    (if (str_eq (st-first-id "a-channeled-source") "method")
                        (if (str_eq (st-first-id "urs-dancing-at-one-am") "threefold-soul") 1 0)
                        0) 0) 0) 0))

    ;; the dancing situation is the one that fires MORE than one lens, and the
    ;; three it fires are the right three
    (defn st-dancing-fires-three? ()
        (if (eq (st-answer-size "urs-dancing-at-one-am") 3) 1 0))

    ;; ── the band's fourteen readings, at BIT weights ────────────────
    (defn st-check ()
        (add (if (eq (st-count) 9) 1 0)
        (add (if (eq (st-all-attributed?) 1) 2 0)
        (add (if (eq (st-all-speak?) 1) 4 0)
        (add (if (eq (st-composted-count) 0) 8 0)
        (add (if (eq (st-frozen-count) 8) 16 0)
        (add (if (eq (st-witnessed-count) 1) 32 0)
        (add (if (eq (st-split-sorted?) 1) 64 0)
        (add (if (eq (st-no-universal-lens?) 1) 128 0)
        (add (if (eq (st-uncovered-is-empty?) 1) 256 0)
        (add (if (eq (st-answers-distinct?) 1) 512 0)
        (add (if (eq (st-dancing-fires-three?) 1) 1024 0)
        (add (if (eq (st-answer-size "recognition-room") 1) 2048 0)
        (add (if (eq (st-answer-size "this-kernel") 1)
                 (if (eq (st-witnessed-size "this-kernel") 1) 4096 0) 0)
        (add (if (eq (len (st-situations)) 6) 8192 0)
             0)))))))))))))))

    0)
